  "wizardCurrencyStepTitle": "Currency",
  "wizardCurrencyStepHelper": "## Currency\n\nSet up which currencies exist in your world and how they convert.\n\nStart with the smallest unit (e.g. copper) and work your way up to the largest. For each further currency, enter how many of the previous one it is worth (in many fantasy RPGs: 10 copper = 1 silver).",
