  "wizardLocationsStepHelper": "## Places of finding (optional)\n\nFrom here on it is about items and crafting. You only need this and the following steps (places of finding, item categories, items, recipes) if you play with them. **Skip** takes you straight to the summary; data you already entered stays.\n\nSome items can be found in certain places: on the beach, in caves, in grottos and so on. Add those places here so you can link them to items in the next steps.",
